# ~/.config 백업 — 기본은 전부 포함, 아래(비밀정보·캐시·앱 데이터)만 제외

# ── 비밀정보 (토큰·키·비밀번호·계정) ──
/gh/
/antigravity/
/kdeconnect/
/pulse/
/libaccounts-glib/
/opencode/service.json
/opencode/*.rea.backup*
/obs-studio/plugin_config/obs-websocket/
/obs-studio/basic/profiles/*/service.json
/Vencord/settings/settings.json

# ── 브라우저 / Electron 앱 데이터 (프로필·쿠키·캐시) ──
/discord/
/vesktop/
/fluxer/
/tetrio-desktop/
/t3code-v2/
/Antigravity/
/Antigravity IDE/
/Token Monitor/
/Termius/
/google-chrome/
/mozilla/
/zen/
/naver-whale/
/net.imput.helium/
/Vencord/dist/

# ── 상태·캐시·로그 ──
/session/
/dconf/
/tokscale/*
!/tokscale/settings.json
/OpenTabletDriver/Logs/
/obs-studio/logs/
/obs-studio/crashes/
/obs-studio/updates/
/obs-studio/profiler_data/
/ghidra/**/osgi/
/ghidra/**/symbols/
/JetBrains/**/event-log-metadata/
/JetBrains/**/workspace/
/JetBrains/**/tasks/
/JetBrains/**/ssl/
/JetBrains/**/*.db
/REAPER/Data/
/REAPER/MetadataCaches/
/REAPER/reaper-*.ini.bak
/unity3d/**/Analytics/
/unity3d/**/*.log
/hypr_backup_*/
/hypr/scripts/backup/
/waybar/backup/

# ── 공통 ──
node_modules/
__pycache__/
Cache/
GPUCache/
Crashpad/
*.log
*.lock
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
*.bak
/REAPER/ColorThemes/Default_*
/REAPER/Scripts/Cockos/
/JetBrains/**/*.vmoptions
